 "title": "Derived sections after inverse image along a continuous cocontinuous site morphism",
 "statement": "Let $u:\\mathcal C\\to\\mathcal D$ be a continuous and cocontinuous functor of sites in the common size universe [def-weil-pbc-sites-and-cohomology, def-weil-size-convention], and let $g:\\mathrm{Sh}(\\mathcal C)\\to\\mathrm{Sh}(\\mathcal D)$ be the induced geometric morphism [def-trf-geometric-morphism]. For every object $U\\in\\mathcal C$ and every $M\\in D^+(\\mathrm{Ab}(\\mathcal D))$ [def-weil-abstract-derived-category, def-weil-pbc-bounded-derived-subcategories], the canonical comparison\n$$R\\Gamma(U,g^{-1}M)\\xrightarrow{\\sim}R\\Gamma(u(U),M)$$\nis an isomorphism, natural in $M$.",
